# Port of tests/pkg.rs:8828-8885. The Rust test faked a closed-status crypto
# helper; Jet keygen draws from the OS, so the failure is the real one: the
# crypto_entropy no-entropy wrapper makes getrandom fail with ENOSYS for jet.
# Setup: bare_registry(registry.git), init_clean_project(project,"entropyfail","1.0.0");
# keys and registry-cache stay absent.
